 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS CloudTrail API (2013-11-01). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Trails are stored configuration: logging never starts, no event is recorded or delivered to Amazon S3, Amazon SNS or CloudWatch Logs, and the named bucket, topic, log group, role and KMS key are not checked. Trails are kept in their home Region only: multi-Region trails create no shadow trails (so includeShadowTrails has no effect) and ListTrails lists the requested Region; organization trails are refused because the simulator account is not in an organization. DescribeTrails returns every trail of the Region and refuses trailNameList; StartLogging, event selectors, insights, CloudTrail Lake, channels, dashboards and LookupEvents return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Tags supplied at creation are stored, but AddTags, RemoveTags and ListTags are not implemented.",
  "title": "AWS CloudTrail (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2013-11-01"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
